## 14. Out of Memory errors

Link: <https://www.freqtrade.io/en/stable/hyperopt/#out-of-memory-errors>

Try --analyze-per-epoch to reduce RAM when tuning strategies with many .range parameters.

And you can reduce memory load by using the -j -2 flag, which leaves one CPU free. (-1 is all CPUs) and 1 removes parallel processing completely. Not recommended until last resort.
